    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20051206.0048\n\nMUSAYYIB, Iraq, Dec 6 , 2005\n\nNine bodies found south of Baghdad\n\n\n\n\nPolice have discovered nine bodies of Iraqi civilians shot dead near Mussayab, south of the capital, police said Tuesday.\n\nThe victims had all been shot at close range and were men in their 30s, added police.\n\nIraq has seen a spike of violence in the run-up to legislative elections on December 15.",
